# Trivy Ignore List for nodate-flow
# Each entry must include a reason for the ignore.
# Format: CVE-ID  # reason
#
# Review this file periodically and remove entries when upstream fixes
# are available or when the affected component is no longer used.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Development-only dependencies (not shipped in production images)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# No CVEs currently ignored. This file exists so Trivy picks it up
# automatically and team members have a clear place to document
# accepted risks.
#
# Example format (uncomment and replace when needed):
# CVE-2024-XXXXX  # dev-only: affects vitest runner, not in production image
# CVE-2024-YYYYY  # false positive: function is never called in our code path
